          "id": "835042df156c9d42f837729dfb22c4752a812141",
          "message": "Match level-6 PNG sizes with adaptive filtering and dynamic DEFLATE\n\nReplace fixed codes and shallow matching with cost-selected blocks, bounded lazy chains and profitable short matches. Score complete rows with AVX2/NEON to avoid sampled filter misses. Add size regressions, compressor differential fuzzing and compression diagnostics; document the measured size and speed tradeoffs.",
